{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22090","headline":"新乐府 秦吉了\t哀冤民也 · 白居易","name":"新乐府 秦吉了\t哀冤民也","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦吉了，出南中，彩毛青黑花颈红。\n耳聪心慧舌端巧，鸟语人言无不通。\n昨日长爪鸢，今朝大觜乌。\n鸢捎乳燕一窠覆，乌琢母鸡双眼枯。\n鸡号堕地燕惊去，然後拾卵攫其雏。\n岂无鵰与鹗，嗉中肉饱不肯搏。\n亦有鸾鹤羣，闲立高扬如不闻。\n秦吉了，人云尔是能言鸟。\n岂不见鸡燕之冤苦，吾闻凤皇百鸟主。\n尔竟不爲凤皇之前致一言，安用噪噪闲言语。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22090.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22090","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}